# Substrate top-side bond pads. Each site is directly below the matching
# die-side micro-bump; coordinates are local to SubChiplet.  The 3DBlox bump
# representation supplies dbChipNet endpoints; the web view renders this
# region as a planar pad rather than as a protruding bump.
# Format: bumpInstName  bumpCellType  x  y  portName  netName

bond_NET_A           BUMP         1980.0000    1640.0000 port_BOND_NET_A  NET_A
bond_NET_B           BUMP         1660.0000    1480.0000 port_BOND_NET_B  NET_B
bond_NET_C           BUMP         1820.0000    1480.0000 port_BOND_NET_C  NET_C
bond_NET_D           BUMP         1980.0000    1480.0000 port_BOND_NET_D  NET_D
bond_NET_E           BUMP         1980.0000    1320.0000 port_BOND_NET_E  NET_E
